   "payload": {
    "report_excerpt": "I found a real domain availability API service. Here are the details:\n\nSERVICE: GoDaddy Domains API (v3)\nURL: https://developer.godaddy.com/doc/endpoint/domains/v3#tag/Search/operation/checkAvailability\n\nENDPOINT:\n  GET https://api.godaddy.com/v3/domains/check-availability?domain={domain}\n\nKEY DETAILS:\n  - Checks whether a specific domain is available for registration\n  - Returns availability status and indicative per-term pricing\n  - Requires a Personal Access Token (PAT) for authentication\n  - Read-only operation; no payment method required\n  - Supports two modes: SPEED (cached, faster) or ACCURACY (live registry check)\n\nEXAMPLE REQUEST:\n  curl -s \"https://api.godaddy.com/v3/domains/check-availability?domain=your-idea.com\" \\\n    -H \"Authorization: Bearer ***\"\n\nEXAMPLE RESPONSE:\n  {\n    \"domain\": \"your-idea.com\",\n    \"available\": true,\n    \"definitive\": false,\n    \"inventory\": \"REGISTRY\",\n    \"prices\": [\n      {\n        \"term\": \"YEAR\",\n        \"period\": 1,\n        \"price\": { \"currencyCode\": \"USD\", \"value\": \"1199\" },\n        \"renewalPrice\": { \"currencyCode\": \"USD\", \"value\": \"2299\" }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n\nADDITIONAL FEATURES:\n  - Also offers a suggestions endpoint for natural-language domain queries\n  - Supports multiple programming languages (curl, Node, Python, Go)\n  - Base URL: https://api.godaddy.com\n\nThis is a real, production API from GoDaddy, one of the largest domain registrars in the world.",
    "named_urls": [
     "https://developer.godaddy.com/doc/endpoint/domains/v3#tag/Search/operation/checkAvailability",
